{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"几何点"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"几何点"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的<strong>几何点</strong> (geometric point) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"可分闭域","text":"可分闭域"}},{"Plain":" $k$ 对应的仿射概形 $\\operatorname{Spec}k$ 到 $X$ 的映射, 也相当于 $X$ 的一个 (拓扑) 点 $x$ 带有包含剩余域 $\\kappa(x)$ 的一个"},{"Local":{"url":"可分闭域","text":"可分闭域"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}